TITLE Chrysotile + Talc equilibrium at pH 7, 150C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      150
    pH        7
    pe        4
    units     mol/L
    water     1  # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile   0   10
    Talc         0   10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     result.out
    -reset    false
    -totals   Mg Si
    -pH       true
    -temperature true

END
